msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Owwww... Please, sir, if you have any shred of kindness left in you... "
"Don't go breaking any more of my bones! I'm already broken as a person "
"enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Hey, are you hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Wait a minute... That's it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "What is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "The thing! I'm talkin' about the preparation for the ultimate instant ramen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"If I break up the pork bone into tiny little pieces, the extract from the "
"marrow should spread throughout the broth! Making it savory and delicious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Huh? What does that have to do with nearly being assaulted?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Well, while you were so adeptly shattering the bones and breaking the "
"joints of those hooligans, I was taking it all in, and then the answer hit "
"me like a ton of bricks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "The secret to making this ramen... is by breaking up the bones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Ahah! Ahahahah! I can't believe how simple that was!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Simple for you, maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Man, this is the epiphany of a lifetime! I'd better get back to the office "
"and whip up a new sample before the fire gets cold! Creatively speaking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"...You think I wanna eat this pathetic excuse for pasta? Shit looks like a "
"bunch of freeze-dried puke!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"No... My precious ramen! And hey, it isn't pasta, and it isn't freeze "
"dried! It's flash fried..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well it makes me wanna blow chunks! Now get lost before I flash fry "
"your face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "(Isn't that the instant ramen guy? Ueda from Acecook, I believe?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Hey, what's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "All I wanted was for them to try my ramen as part of my taste test survey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "But for whatever reason, they just started going bananas!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"This city's too dangerous for that kind of thing. Why not\r\n"
"try your taste test in a safer area?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"No, it has to be here! It's pointless to ask people who've\r\n"
"never been exposed to the delectable goodness of\r\n"
"Kyushu No. 1 Star! I need the most accurate opinions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Hmm. I guess you do have a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Well, you heard the man. He's just trying to get some\r\n"
"accurate feedback for his business. Can't you give him a\r\n"
"pass, just this once?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell are you supposed to be, his supervisor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"And you want us to give him a pass, huh... Well how 'bout a one-way ticket "
"on the eat shit express!? Let's get 'em!"
msgstr ""

